    {
      "source": "The destination name for this listener, resolved through a\n<a href=\"../listener/support/TopicResolver.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.listener.support\"><code>TopicResolver</code></a> strategy.",
      "translation": "此监听器的目标名称，通过 <a href=\"../listener/support/TopicResolver.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.redis.listener.support 中的接口\"><code>TopicResolver</code></a> 策略解析得出。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "The bean name of the <a href=\"../listener/RedisMessageListenerContainer.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.listener\"><code>RedisMessageListenerContainer</code></a> to subscribe\nwith.",
      "translation": "要订阅的<a href=\"../listener/RedisMessageListenerContainer.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.listener\"><code>RedisMessageListenerContainer</code></a>的 Bean 名称。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "The unique identifier of the container managing this endpoint.",
      "translation": "管理此端点的容器的唯一标识符。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Processing of <code>@RedisListener</code> annotations is performed by registering a\n<a href=\"RedisListenerAnnotationBeanPostProcessor.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.annotation\"><code>RedisListenerAnnotationBeanPostProcessor</code></a>. This can be done manually or, more conveniently, through the\n<a href=\"EnableRedisListeners.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.data.redis.annotation\"><code>@EnableRedisListeners</code></a> annotation.",
      "translation": "`@RedisListener` 注解的处理是通过注册一个 <a href=\"RedisListenerAnnotationBeanPostProcessor.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.annotation\"><code>RedisListenerAnnotationBeanPostProcessor</code></a> 来实现的。这可以手动完成，或者更方便地通过 <a href=\"EnableRedisListeners.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.data.redis.annotation\"><code>@EnableRedisListeners</code></a> 注解来完成。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<small>Copyright © 2011–2026 <a href=\"https://www.spring.io\">Pivotal Software, Inc.</a>. All rights reserved.</small>",
      "translation": "<small>版权所有 © 2011–2026 <a href=\"https://www.spring.io\">Pivotal Software, Inc.</a>。保留所有权利。</small>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Annotated Redis listener methods are allowed to have flexible signatures similar to what <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/messaging/handler/annotation/MessageMapping.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.messaging.handler.annotation\"><code>MessageMapping</code></a>\nprovides:",
      "translation": "注解的 Redis 监听器方法可以具有灵活的签名，类似于 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/messaging/handler/annotation/MessageMapping.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.messaging.handler.annotation\"><code>MessageMapping</code></a> 所提供的功能：",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "This annotation can be used as a <em><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/annotation/Repeatable.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang.annotation\">repeatable</a></em> annotation.",
      "translation": "此注解可用作 <em><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/annotation/Repeatable.html\" title=\"java.lang.annotation 中的类或接口\">可重复</a></em> 注解。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "This annotation may be used as a <em>meta-annotation</em> to create custom <em>composed annotations</em> with\nattribute overrides.",
      "translation": "此注解可作为<em>元注解</em>，用于创建具有属性覆盖的自定义<em>组合注解</em>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "If none is specified, an auto-generated one is provided.",
      "translation": "若未指定，则提供自动生成的内容。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "The destination name for this listener, resolved through a\n<a href=\"../listener/support/TopicResolver.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.listener.support\"><code>TopicResolver</code></a> strategy. Alias for <a href=\"#topic()\"><code>topic()</code></a>.",
      "translation": "此监听器的目标名称，通过<a href=\"../listener/support/TopicResolver.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.listener.support\"><code>TopicResolver</code></a>策略解析。此为<a href=\"#topic()\"><code>topic()</code></a>的别名。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Configure the primary mapping by MIME type that is consumed by the handler method. Setting <code>consumes</code> defines\nthe message content type as Redis Pub/Sub messages do not feature headers to indicate a content type towards\nmessage converter selection. Examples:\n\n<pre class=\"code\">consumes = \"text/plain\"\nconsumes = \"application/*\"\n</pre>",
      "translation": "配置由处理器方法消耗的基于 MIME 类型的主映射。设置 `<code>consumes</code>` 可定义消息内容类型，因为 Redis Pub/Sub 消息没有用于指示内容类型的标头，因此无法据此选择消息转换器。示例：\n\n<pre class=\"code\">consumes = \"text/plain\"\nconsumes = \"application/*\"\n</pre>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Configure the primary mapping by MIME type that is consumed by the handler method.",
      "translation": "配置由处理程序方法消耗的基于 MIME 类型的主映射。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/messaging/handler/annotation/Header.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.messaging.handler.annotation\"><code>@Header</code></a>-annotated method arguments to extract\nspecific header values, including Redis headers defined by\n<a href=\"../listener/support/PubSubHeaders.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.listener.support\"><code>PubSubHeaders</code></a>",
      "translation": "用于提取特定标头值的带有 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/messaging/handler/annotation/Header.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.messaging.handler.annotation\"><code>@Header</code></a> 注解的方法参数，包括由 <a href=\"../listener/support/PubSubHeaders.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.listener.support\"><code>PubSubHeaders</code></a> 定义的 Redis 标头。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/messaging/handler/annotation/Headers.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.messaging.handler.annotation\"><code>@Headers</code></a>-annotated method argument that must\nalso be assignable to <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Map.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Map</code></a> for obtaining access to all headers",
      "translation": "必须同时可赋值给 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Map.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Map</code></a> 的带有 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/messaging/handler/annotation/Headers.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.messaging.handler.annotation\"><code>@Headers</code></a> 注解的方法参数，以便获取所有标头。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<a href=\"../listener/Topic.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.listener\"><code>Topic</code></a> to get access to the Redis topic",
      "translation": "通过 <a href=\"../listener/Topic.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.redis.listener 中的接口\"><code>Topic</code></a> 访问 Redis 主题。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/messaging/Message.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.messaging\"><code>Message</code></a> to use Spring's messaging abstraction",
      "translation": "<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/messaging/Message.html\" title=\"org.springframework.messaging 中的类或接口\"><code>Message</code></a> 用于使用 Spring 的消息抽象机制",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/messaging/handler/annotation/Payload.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.messaging.handler.annotation\"><code>@Payload</code></a>-annotated method arguments, including\nsupport for validation",
      "translation": "带有<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/messaging/handler/annotation/Payload.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.messaging.handler.annotation\"><code>@Payload</code></a>注解的方法参数，包括对验证的支持。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/messaging/MessageHeaders.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.messaging\"><code>MessageHeaders</code></a> arguments for obtaining access to all headers",
      "translation": "<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/messaging/MessageHeaders.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.messaging\"><code>MessageHeaders</code></a> 参数用于获取对所有标头的访问权限。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/messaging/support/MessageHeaderAccessor.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.messaging.support\"><code>MessageHeaderAccessor</code></a> for convenient access to all method\narguments",
      "translation": "<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/messaging/support/MessageHeaderAccessor.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.messaging.support\"><code>MessageHeaderAccessor</code></a> 用于方便地访问所有方法参数。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Ilyass Bougati, Mark Paluch",
      "translation": "伊利亚斯·布加蒂，马克·帕卢赫",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Optional Element Summary",
      "translation": "可选元素摘要",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Element Details",
      "translation": "元素详情",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Annotation that marks a method to be the target of a Redis Pub/Sub message listener on the specified <a href=\"#topic()\"><code>topic()</code></a>.\nThe <a href=\"#container()\"><code>container()</code></a> identifies the <a href=\"../listener/RedisMessageListenerContainer.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.listener\"><code>RedisMessageListenerContainer</code></a>\nto subscribe with. If not set, a <em>default</em> container is assumed to be available with a bean name of\n<code>redisMessageListenerContainer</code> unless an explicit default has been provided through configuration.",
      "translation": "用于标记方法为指定<a href=\"#topic()\"><code>topic()</code></a>的 Redis 发布/订阅消息监听目标的注解。\n<a href=\"#container()\"><code>container()</code></a>标识用于订阅的<a href=\"../listener/RedisMessageListenerContainer.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.listener\"><code>RedisMessageListenerContainer</code></a>。如果未设置，则假定存在一个默认容器，其 Bean 名称为<code>redisMessageListenerContainer</code>，除非已通过配置显式提供了默认值。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<ul>\n<li>通过 <a href=\"../listener/Topic.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.redis.listener 中的接口\"><code>Topic</code></a> 访问 Redis 主题。</li>\n<li><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/messaging/Message.html\" title=\"org.springframework.messaging 中的类或接口\"><code>Message</code></a> 用于使用 Spring 的消息抽象机制</li>\n<li>带有<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/messaging/handler/annotation/Payload.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.messaging.handler.annotation\"><code>@Payload</code></a>注解的方法参数，包括对验证的支持。</li>\n<li>用于提取特定标头值的带有 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/messaging/handler/annotation/Header.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.messaging.handler.annotation\"><code>@Header</code></a> 注解的方法参数，包括由 <a href=\"../listener/support/PubSubHeaders.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.listener.support\"><code>PubSubHeaders</code></a> 定义的 Redis 标头。</li>\n<li>必须同时可赋值给 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Map.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Map</code></a> 的带有 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/messaging/handler/annotation/Headers.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.messaging.handler.annotation\"><code>@Headers</code></a> 注解的方法参数，以便获取所有标头。</li>\n<li><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/messaging/MessageHeaders.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.messaging\"><code>MessageHeaders</code></a> 参数用于获取对所有标头的访问权限。</li>\n<li><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/messaging/support/MessageHeaderAccessor.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.messaging.support\"><code>MessageHeaderAccessor</code></a> 用于方便地访问所有方法参数。</li>\n</ul>",
      "translation": "<ul>\n<li>通过 <a href=\"../listener/Topic.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.redis.listener 中的接口\"><code>Topic</code></a> 访问 Redis 主题。</li>\n<li><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/messaging/Message.html\" title=\"org.springframework.messaging 中的类或接口\"><code>Message</code></a> 用于使用 Spring 的消息抽象机制。</li>\n<li>带有 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/messaging/handler/annotation/Payload.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.messaging.handler.annotation\"><code>@Payload</code></a> 注解的方法参数，包括对验证的支持。</li>\n<li>用于提取特定标头值的带有 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/messaging/handler/annotation/Header.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.messaging.handler.annotation\"><code>@Header</code></a> 注解的方法参数，包括由 <a href=\"../listener/support/PubSubHeaders.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.listener.support\"><code>PubSubHeaders</code></a> 定义的 Redis 标头。</li>\n<li>必须同时可赋值给 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Map.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Map</code></a> 的带有 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/messaging/handler/annotation/Headers.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.messaging.handler.annotation\"><code>@Headers</code></a> 注解的方法参数，以便获取所有标头。</li>\n<li><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/messaging/MessageHeaders.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.messaging\"><code>MessageHeaders</code></a> 参数用于获取对所有标头的访问权限。</li>\n<li><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/messaging/support/MessageHeaderAccessor.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.messaging.support\"><code>MessageHeaderAccessor</code></a> 用于方便地访问所有方法参数。</li>\n</ul>",
      "count": 1
    }
  ]
